# =============================================================================
# ImmortalWrt 源码专属插件（所有档位）
#
# 清单叠加顺序：common.list → <源码>.list → <档位>.list → <源码>-<档位>.list
# 指令格式见 config/packages/common.list 顶部说明。
# =============================================================================

# 说明：AdGuardHome / MosDNS 的克隆指令原在已删除的精简版清单中，现不再安装。
# 如需启用，按下面的写法追加（AdGuardHome 有两条仓库可互为回退）：
#
# sparse main https://github.com/kenzok8/small-package package/luci-app-adguardhome luci-app-adguardhome || \
#   sparse openwrt-23.05 https://github.com/coolsnowwolf/luci package/applications/luci-app-adguardhome applications/luci-app-adguardhome


# drop mosdns and v2ray-geodata packages that come with the source
run find ./ | grep Makefile | grep v2ray-geodata | xargs rm -f
run find ./ | grep Makefile | grep mosdns | xargs rm -f

clone https://github.com/sbwml/luci-app-mosdns package/mosdns v5
clone https://github.com/sbwml/v2ray-geodata package/v2ray-geodata
